  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "tls-utils: Fix signature of ssl_md_update static function",
  "description": "ssl_md_update directly passes data along to gcry_md_write. gcry_md_write\nexpects a const void* (and has for at least 22 years.) ssl_md_update\nshould thus be declared with data being a const pointer. As tvb_get_ptr\n(correctly) returns a const pointer, fixing this signature allows\nremoving all the unnecessary casting away of the const qualifier.\n\nhttps://www.gnupg.org/documentation/manuals/gcrypt/Working-with-hash-algorithms.html",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:58:35.662Z",
